{"id":"4ba460c900107e00","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound.md","title":"Constructed Fixed Point and Its Degree Bound","display":"thm-fixed-point-degree-bound — Constructed Fixed Point and Its Degree Bound","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound","aliases":["89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"thm-fixed-point-degree-bound — Constructed Fixed Point and Its Degree Bound","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point-algorithm]]","[[89-df-fixed-point]]","[[89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound]]","[[89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point]]","[[89-thm-gl-decidable]]","[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fixed-point-degree-bound — Constructed Fixed Point and Its Degree Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6d8c3016a32d17f8\" href=\"?note=6d8c3016a32d17f8\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-algorithm\">89-df-fixed-point-algorithm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"85e306b51d3267ec\" href=\"?note=85e306b51d3267ec\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point\">89-df-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"16ae22435ebdf5f5\" href=\"?note=16ae22435ebdf5f5\" title=\"89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound\">89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0b83ca065132609\" href=\"?note=a0b83ca065132609\" title=\"89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point\">89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f0380129bd9e48f3\" href=\"?note=f0380129bd9e48f3\" title=\"89-thm-gl-decidable\">89-thm-gl-decidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" href=\"?note=b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" title=\"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0157f8bea9275cf1\" href=\"?note=0157f8bea9275cf1\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness\">89-thm-gl-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\">\\(H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\)</span> 为有限 character 构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为原书加强且不添加字母的不动点谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{md}\">\\(\\mathrm{md}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{\\Box}\">\\(b_{\\Box}\\)</span> 为度数和不同盒子公式数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}degree\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p))\n\\land\\mathrm{md}(H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p))\\le b_{\\Box}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}degree\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p))\n\\land\\mathrm{md}(H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p))\\le b_{\\Box}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 114–116；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>在任意有限 GL 模型中，设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\models\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\">\\(w\\models\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\)</span>，取唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-character <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\models H\">\\(w\\models H\\)</span>，唯一性迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是所选析取项，其筛选定理使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\models p\">\\(w\\models p\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\models p\">\\(w\\models p\\)</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 未被选中，判定正确性及有限完全性给另一有限 GL 模型的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，满足同一 dotted-box 方程和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 假；这违反 character 界引理。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\models p\\leftrightarrow H\">\\(w\\models p\\leftrightarrow H\\)</span>。\n有限完全性得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\to(p\\leftrightarrow H)\">\\(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\to(p\\leftrightarrow H)\\)</span> 可证，Goldfarb 判据给完整加强等价。字母限制由构造，degree 界由每个 character 的界与析取不增加盒深度。空析取的度数为 0，也满足界。此处给出原书第二种证明，不依赖不动点存在定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-algorithm","status":"resolved","id":"6d8c3016a32d17f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-algorithm]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound","status":"resolved","id":"16ae22435ebdf5f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAncho