"anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a74a9caa29e2a312","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一般有限构造：[[89-df-modal-degree]] → [[89-df-modal-characters]] → [[89-lem-modal-character-partition]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound]] → [[89-df-fixed-point-algorithm]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["6d8c3016a32d17f8","85e306b51d3267ec","16ae22435ebdf5f5","a0b83ca065132609","f0380129bd9e48f3","b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","0157f8bea9275cf1"]}